      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَيْضٌ</span></b>  <i>An abortive fœtus, not completely
formed;</i> (Katádeh, K;) i. e. <i>less than seven months
old.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  (tropical:)  <i>Little;</i> or <i>a small quantity:</i> as in
the saying, or in <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْطَاهُ غَيْضًا مِنْ فَيْضٍ</span> (tropical:)  <i>He gave
him little from much.</i> (S, A, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <i>An abundance of the trees called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْلَاث</span>; i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرْفَآء</span> <i>and</i>
